{"version":1,"content":"<p>「大美人」林青霞昨日（3日）迎來72歲生日，今年她選擇不鋪張、不舉辦大型慶生派對，僅和家人簡單團聚，享受難得的家庭時光。</p><p>據指，生日餐枱上少不了她喜愛的大閘蟹和火鍋，一家人圍枱共享美食，在溫馨氣氛中迎接生日。</p><p>談到生日願望，林青霞的回答也是一貫</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T20:20:50.473239+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T20:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:15.245942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:15.245942+00:00","content_hash":"dd0ae809fbc5dca4347f1ea0b5ebb89d93038abf8f979b9b4d3de231829aec30","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}